flowchart LR
  S[Decision Subject] --> R[Discovery Request]
  C[Context Envelope] --> R
  O[Objective + Constraints] --> R
  R --> G[company_id Guard]
  G --> P[Provider Fan-out]
  P --> A[Actions]
  P --> RS[Resources]
  P --> SP[Suppliers]
  P --> AS[Assignments]
  P --> I[Interventions]
  P --> SC[Schedules]
  P --> ST[Strategies]
  P --> T[Tools]
  P --> RR[Resolutions]
  A & RS & SP & AS & I & SC & ST & T & RR --> N[Normalize Candidates]
  N --> F[Feasibility + Constraints]
  F --> D[Consolidate Duplicates / Preserve Provenance]
  D --> OS[OptionSet]
  OS --> X[Later Comparison / Prediction / Ranking]
  OS -. no recommendation or execution authority .-> GOV[Governed execution boundary]
